{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26936","headline":"和裴结端公早朝 · 姚合","name":"和裴结端公早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼钥千门啓，鸡人唱晓传。\n冕旒临玉殿，丞相入炉烟。\n列位同居左，分行忝在前。\n仰闻天语近，俯拜佩声连。\n彩杖祥光动，彤庭霁色鲜。\n威仪谁可纪，柱史有新篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}